H_0007> local on the target<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>, or\n<TEXTITOPEN_0003>local on the base for the <MATH_0008>-topology<TEXTITCLOSE_0003> if for any\n<MATH_0009>-covering <MATH_0010> of algebraic spaces\nand any morphism of algebraic spaces <MATH_0011> we\nhave\n<MATHSEG_0001> has <MATHSEG_0002>each <MATHSEG_0003> has <MATHSEG_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:cc31a0cde1e01fe4c8b0004736277243b3a5ad2f82de20d5badc041fee59f3e6", "unit_id": "tag:03YH:statement"}
{"chapter": "spaces-descent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "03YG", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0002": "$X \\to Y$", "MATH_0003": "$X' \\to Y'$", "MATH_0004": "$X \\to Y$", "MATH_0005": "$\\tau$", "MATH_0006": "$\\tau$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:5f45c720fd6cfd86d598936488760e40cf997cf96795b91da8ee5633b5ecb810", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5ed5562fad100caf1f0760c65b8eca29184b48104f58ef50b1ba966e6706fbcc", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nTo be sure, since isomorphisms are always coverings\nwe see (or require) that property <MATH_0001> holds for <MATH_0002>\nif and only if it holds for any arrow <MATH_0003> isomorphic to <MATH_0004>.\nIf a property is <MATH_0005>-local on the target then it is preserved\nby base changes by morphisms which occur in <MATH_0006>-coverings. Here\nis a formal statement.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3ea4c965efeed492e171decb2f2a1106004c3c93b29ff8806699354e984652ac", "unit_id": "tag:03YG:prose-0002"}
